                     /lat_lon="38.5344217 N 123.03846339 W"
                     /collection_date="13-Dec-2022"
                     /collected_by="Harte Singer"
                     /note="Taxonomy Notes: Northeast of the home in mixed leaf
                     litter very close to tanoak and madrone Notes: Sequence
                     was messy and somewhat short but was only 1 nucleotide
                     different from
                     https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/64571404 and
                     https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/19103937. I would
                     argue that the sequence is not reliable enough in this
                     case to differentiate this from L. manzanitae, and
                     although the features are atypical for that taxon, growth
                     conditions might be contributory. Host tree is Madrone,
                     which is closely related to Manzanita. Will take
                     reexamination of this material and collection of
